  "sourceTitle": "Cajun Tuna",
  "sourceText": "Cajun Tuna\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 8:51am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 can White albacore tuna, drained in spring water\n1 tablespoon Chipote pepper,\ncup Green onions,\n1 teaspoon White pepper\ncup Celery, finely chopped\ncup Mayo, (low-cal)\ncup Boiled egg, chopped\n2 tablespoons Pickle relish,\nPickled orka,\nFrench bread,\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix well. Serve on french bread with pickled okra. 2 Stanley Jackon, Kabby's, New Orleans Hilton Riverside",
